:: Fishing Moor Lurker Attack
<<effects>>
<<set $fishingLurkerAttackLocation to random(1, 4)>>
You're watching your <<fishingBob>> when lurkers leap out of the reeds,
<<if $fishingLurkerAttackLocation is 1>>
	<span class="red">one of them leaping on your face</span> before you can react, their chittering filling your ears.
<<elseif $fishingLurkerAttackLocation is 2>>
	<span class="red">one of them leaping on your chest</span> before you can react, their chittering filling your ears.
<<elseif $fishingLurkerAttackLocation is 3>>
	<span class="red">one of them leaping between your legs</span> before you can react, their chittering filling your ears.
<<else>>
	their chittering filling your ears.
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Fight|Fishing Moor Lurker Molestation]]>><<set $struggle_start to 1>><</link>>


:: Fishing Moor Lurker Molestation
<<effects>>
<<if $struggle_start is 1>>
	<<struggle_init>>
	<<set $struggle.creature to "lurker">>
	<<struggle_creatures 3 2>>
	<<set $combat to 1>>
	<<controlloss>>
	<<violence 1>>
	<<molested>>
	<<if $fishingLurkerAttackLocation is 1>>
		<<set $struggle.mouth.creature to "lurker">>
		<<set $mouthuse to "struggle">>
		<<set $mouthstate to "struggle">>
		<<set $struggle.enemy[0].location to "mouth">>
	<<elseif $fishingLurkerAttackLocation is 2>>
		<<set $struggle.chest.creature to "lurker">>
		<<set $chestuse to "struggle">>
		<<set $cheststate to "struggle">>
		<<set $struggle.enemy[0].location to "chest">>
	<<elseif $fishingLurkerAttackLocation is 3>>
		<<if $player.penisExist>>
			<<set $struggle.penis.creature to "lurker">>
			<<set $penisuse to "struggle">>
			<<set $penisstate to "struggle">>
			<<set $struggle.enemy[0].location to "penis">>
		<<else>>
			<<set $struggle.vagina.creature to "lurker">>
			<<set $vaginause to "struggle">>
			<<set $vaginastate to "struggle">>
			<<set $struggle.enemy[0].location to "vagina">>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
	<<unset $fishingLurkerAttackLocation>>
	<<set $timer to 16>>
	<<unset $struggle_start>>
<</if>>

<<if ($timer is 14 or $timer is 10 or $timer is 7) and $rng gte 50>>
	<<struggle_add 1 2>>
	<span class="pink">Another lurker leaps from the reeds!</span>
	<br><br>
<</if>>

<<struggle>>

<<if $struggle.done gte $struggle.number>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Fishing Moor Lurker Finish]]>><</link>></span>
<<else>>
	<span id="next"><<link [[Next|Fishing Moor Lurker Molestation]]>><</link>></span>
<</if>>


:: Fishing Moor Lurker Finish
<<effects>>
<<set $fishing.fishingMoor.event to "none">>
<<set $fishing.fishingMoor.eventDanger to 0>>

The lurkers scatter into the reeds, chittering and hissing as they retreat.
<br><br>

<<tearful>> you stumble back to your feet and pick up your fishing rod from the mud.
<br><br>

<<clotheson>>
<<endcombat>>

<<link [[Return to fishing|Fishing Moor Wait]]>><</link>>
<br>
<<link [[Leave|Moor]]>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>


:: Widgets Fishing Moor Event Lurkers [widget]
/* Text that can appear while waiting if lurkers will attack soon */
<<widget "fishingMoorLurkerAttackWaitAmbient">>
	<<addinlineevent 20>>
		<<print either(
			"You think you hear chittering from the reeds around you.",
			"Something splashes in the shallows.",
			"You hear skittering in the grass.",
			"You hear a wet hiss carry across the moor.",
			"You feel like something is watching you."
		)>>
		<<set $fishing.fishingMoor.eventDanger += 1>>
	<</addinlineevent>>
<</widget>>
